Z||000011||Slammed Fiero||04-18-2001||01:03 AM||||Ground control makes them for fiero , you choose the spring rate depending on your purpose , $199 for the set , very nice quality stuffg , uses eibach springs.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.ground-control.com" TARGET=_blank>www.ground-control.com</A> <P>I got really heavy units anticipating an engine swap as well as for autocross use.<P>JM ||||reg||1
